WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:03.200
A support ticket comes in, and the workflow starts.

00:03.300 --> 00:06.400
A model reads it. The customer wants a refund.

00:06.600 --> 00:08.400
Refunds over $100 wait for a person.

00:08.600 --> 00:12.200
Approved. The refund goes out, and the customer hears back.

00:13.200 --> 00:16.800
Cards lift off the board and lean as they travel.

00:16.900 --> 00:21.000
The board opens a gap right where each one lands.

00:22.400 --> 00:24.600
Point across the year, and one label follows.

00:24.900 --> 00:28.800
Drag to measure a stretch. The total counts just those days.

00:29.400 --> 00:31.600
The longest streak, lit on its own.

00:32.200 --> 00:35.400
Then a year back, swept in from the side.
